  Covers: pi-packages/pi-subagents/ — src/, package.json, tsconfig.json, LICENSE.
  Not copied from upstream: test/, docs/, examples/, .github/, media/, and the
  upstream README.md and CHANGELOG.md. node_modules/ is installed in place and
  never committed.
